 "text": "9/29/26, 9:48 AM\n\nTechnical Name                                 CreditWorthinessChangelnformation_In\nNamespace                                        http://sap.com/xi/FICA/Global m%,\nApplication Component                         FI-CA\n\nWeb Service Definition (Back End)           FKK_CREDITWORTHINESSCHGIN\nCategory                                            SAP A2A\n\nDirection                                            inbound\n\nMode                                                asynchronous\n\nIdempotency                                       not applicable\n\nChange/Update Behavior                      Typel\n\nP2P Communication Enabled                  yes\n\nBusiness Context and Use\n\nThe system displays the previous and new values to show you exactly how the debtor\u2019s credit worthiness rating has changed.\n\nRelated Operations\n\ne This inbound service operation has a corrsponding outbound service operation Inform of Credit Worthiness Change for the\nintegration with the SAP Credit Management process component.\n\nFeatures\n\nThe Change Contract Account based Credit Worthiness Change Infomation inbound operation receives information from the\nSAP Credit Management component. This is sent when a debtor\u2019s creditworthiness rating changes. This helps you to ensure that\nyour creditworthiness information is as up to date as possible\n\nThe services operation receives the following data:\n\ne Rating\n\ne Credit limit\n\ne Risk class\n\ne Blocking indicator and its reason code\n\ne Result of a performed credit check\n\nError Handling\n\nForward Error Handling\n\nThe Change Contract Account based Credit Worthiness Change Infomation inbound operation supports Forward Error Handling\n(FEH). The following error categories are used:\n",
